// GTK4 platform package.
//
// Each component in gtk4.sngl overrides the corresponding stdlib abstract component
// with a GTK4-native implementation. The widget types those bodies are written
// against — `GtkButton`, `GtkLabel`, one per GTK class — are the other half of
// this package: the platform generates them from the `Gtk-4.0.gir`
// introspection data installed on the machine, since the widget set is a
// property of the host and not of this repository. A GIR property becomes a
// typed prop, a GLib signal an event, and `#[intrinsic("gtk4:<CType>")]` names
// the C type the emitter reads the class's C API back out of the same GIR
// under. With no GIR file the platform reports itself unavailable and
// contributes nothing, gtk4.sngl included.
//
// Inside a `platform gtk4 { ... }` body a native widget tag needs its `gtk4.`
// prefix (e.g. `gtk4.GtkBox`): the stdlib component it overrides is in scope
// too, and carries a body of its own.
//
// The view renderer walks each component body, finds the root
// VisualNode, reads its widget type and prop/event bindings, and emits the
// corresponding GTK4 Go code.
